      "player": "Gem25P Villain",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "Mwahahaha! It seems in my eagerness to unleash my next masterpiece, I have gotten ahead of myself! The game, in its rigid adherence to the rules, reminds me that it is not yet my turn. How droll! These lesser beings must have their moment in the sun, their brief, insignificant turns before the darkness I command swallows everything.\n\nVery well! I shall allow this \"Kimi25 Vorthos\" to proceed. I have no need to interfere with their petty squabbles. My plans are already in motion, and their actions are as inconsequential as the buzzing of flies. I shall watch, and I shall wait. For when my turn comes, their world will be unmade! I pass priority! Cackle.",
