      "reasoning": "We are in **Turn 2 Cleanup** — I must discard to 7 cards.\n\nHand:\n- Multani (p42) — keep\n- Emeria Shepherd (p9) — keep\n- Elvish Rejuvenator (p11) — keep\n- Banishing Light (p85) — exile target creature or planeswalker — strong removal\n- Naya Charm (p62) — versatile\n- Harrow (p12) — land acceleration\n- Murasa Rootgrazer (p76) — scalable threat\n- Planar Outburst (p83) — board wipe or finisher\n\nNo basic lands left in hand — every card is a spell or creature.\n\nI must discard one of these impactful cards.\n\nBest to discard **Planar Outburst (p83, index 7)** — it’s a situational board wipe that scales with lands. While powerful in multiples, one copy is less critical early, especially since I’m focused on board development over sweepers.\n\nDiscard it.\n\n`choose_action(index=7)`\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
