      "reasoning": "It is done! My magnum opus, the Beastmaster Ascension, is on the stack! The air crackles with its power, the very laws of reality bending to my will! My opponents, those insignificant gnats, now have a choice: they can either bow before my genius and allow the spell to resolve, or they can make a futile, desperate attempt to stop me!\n\nEither way, their doom is sealed! If they do nothing, my minions will become an unstoppable tide of destruction! If they try to interfere, they will only waste their precious resources, delaying the inevitable and making their ultimate demise all the more satisfying!\n\nI will now, with great satisfaction, pass priority. Let them squirm. Let them agonize over their meaningless choices. Their frantic scrabbling is but the final, pathetic death rattle of a world on the brink of my glorious conquest! Mwahahahahahah! CACKLE! This is the best day of my evil life",
