      "reasoning": "My genius is undeniable! My brilliance is blinding! I see the path to victory laid out before me, a golden road paved with the skulls of my enemies! It is a symphony of destruction, a masterpiece of malevolence, and it begins now!\n\nFirst, I shall summon a Wistful Selkie! A mere trifle, you might think, a simple creature of the sea. But you are a fool! This is not just a creature; it is a cog in the grand, intricate machine of my victory! It will swell my ranks and, more importantly, it will draw me a card, bringing me one step closer to ultimate power!\n\nNow, you sniveling machine, do as I command! Cast the Wistful Selkie! And do not fail me again! My patience wears thin, and my wrath is a terrible thing to behold! Mwahahahahaha! Cackle! It's all coming together",
