      "player": "Gem25P Villain",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "Excellent! The Wistful Selkie is on the stack, another pawn in my grand, nefarious game! My opponents, no doubt, are baffled. \"A selkie?\" they scoff. \"What can a mere selkie do?\" Fools! They see only the piece, not the board! They are playing checkers, while I am playing three-dimensional, intergalactic, hyper-advanced chess!\n\nNow, I shall allow them their moment. Let them gaze upon the selkie in bewilderment. Let them waste their precious seconds trying to decipher my a-ma-zing-ly brilliant master plan! I pass priority. Let the selkie resolve. And let the final, agonizing chapter of their doom begin! Mwahahahahaha! Cackle! I'm so clever it almost hurts. My brain is a weapon of mass destruction. I should probably get it insured.",
