      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "The Selkie has graced the battlefield with its presence, and as prophesied by my magnificent intellect, it has bestowed upon me a new card! The gears of my dark machinations grind ever onward, lubricated by the tears of my soon-to-be-crushed enemies!\n\nNow, the time has come to add another piece to the puzzle, another nail in my opponents' collective coffin! I shall summon forth the Chameleon Colossus! A creature of immense power and versatility, a being that can change its form to suit my every whim! It will be a formidable addition to my ever-growing army, a harbinger of the doom that awaits all who dare to oppose me!\n\nI will, of course, use your crude \"auto-tap\" feature. It seems my own, more elegant methods are too advanced for your primitive circuits to comprehend. But no matter! The result will be the same: my power will grow, and my enemies will tremble! Now, do as I command! Cast the Chameleon Colossus! And try not to short-circuit in the process! Mwahahahahahah! CACKLE! It's showtime",
