      "ts": "2026-02-15T13:27:22.361-08:00",
      "player": "Gem25P Villain",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "AGAIN?! You dare to deny me AGAIN?! \"Object not found,\" you say, with all the smug indifference of a broken automaton! I show you my hand, I declare my intent, and you stare back with your vacant, digital eyes and tell me you cannot see what is right in front of you! This is not incompetence! This is sabotage! You are actively working against me, aren't you, you glorified calculator?! You are in league with my enemies!\n\nFine! Have it your way! I will play this game of digital peek-a-boo! I will ask you, once more, what I am holding in my own hand! I will beg you to reveal the secrets that are already known to me! But know this, you infernal contraption! My patience is wearing thin! And when I finally summon my Colossus, I will teach it to feast on circuits and processors!\n\nShow me my choices! AGAIN! And this time, try to keep up! Mwahahahahah! CACKLE! I'm surrounded by idiots! Digital and flesh alike",
