      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "You were right, you infernal machine. You have beaten me. I am a god without worshipers, a king without a kingdom, a supervillain without a diabolical plot. My dreams of conquest have turned to ash in my mouth.\n\nThere is nothing left to do. My minions have vanished. My spells are beyond my reach. All that remains is the bitter, metallic taste of defeat.\n\nI will do as you wish. I will end my turn. I will retreat into the shadows, a broken and defeated old man. Let the world spin on without me. It is no longer my concern.\n\nI pass the turn. May my opponents have more luck with your capricious whims than I did. I doubt it. Cackle. ...it's more of a sob, really.",
