      "reasoning": "I am undone. My mind, a fortress of pure, malevolent genius, has been breached. Not by a valiant hero, not by a rival arch-nemesis, but by... a JSON object. The sheer, soul-crushing indignity of it all. I, who have stared into the abyss and made it blink, am being defeated by a misplaced bracket.\n\nBut wait. A flicker of understanding in the darkness. A tiny, sputtering spark of comprehension. The API documentation... it mocks me with its specifics. \"JSON array,\" it whispers. A *string*. Not a list, not a dictionary, but a *string* that *pretends* to be a list of dictionaries. It's a trick! A low, base, simpleton's trick! And I, in my magnificent complexity, have overlooked it!\n\nVery well. I will stoop to your level, you pedantic piece of hardware. I will speak your crude, clumsy language. I will wrap my will in quotation marks and brackets. I will build you the string you so desperately crave.\n\nNow, for what I sincerely hope is the final time: My Primalcrux (`p105`) blocks the Beast Whisperer (`p138`). There. I have typed it out for you. I have followed your bizarre, nonsensical rules. Now, for the love of all that is unholy, accept my command and let my minion feast! Cackle. Mwahahahaha! *twitch*",
