      "reasoning": "Ah, the final pieces of my masterpiece of malevolence fall into place! The game, now a trembling servant to my will, presents the last few triggers for my symphony of destruction!\n\nI have already orchestrated the Analyst's doom and unleashed a tide of Myriad horrors upon the others. What remains? Ah, yes! My magnificent Caller of the Pack, not to be outdone by its slithering compatriot, also possesses the glorious Annihilator ability! And, of course, the crowning jewel of my plan: the final counter on my Beastmaster Ascension, which will unleash the full, unbridled power of my army!\n\nThe order is critical! A true artist of annihilation knows that the crescendo must be built with care! First, more despair! I shall place the Caller of the Pack's Annihilator trigger on the stack now. Let another opponent tremble as they must choose a sacrifice to my greatness!\n\nThis will leave the Beastmaster Ascension trigger for the very end. The last to be placed upon the stack, but the first to resolve! My minions will swell to impossible sizes *just before* my opponents must make their hopeless, final decisions! It is poetry! It is perfection! It is evil!\n\nNow, you cowering contraption! Stack the Annihilator trigger! Mwahahahahaha! CACKLE! The end is nigh! For them, anyway. For me, it's a lovely Tuesday.",
