      "reasoning": "It is finished! My grand, terrible design is complete! The stack is a beautiful, teetering tower of doom, each trigger a brick in the monument to my victory! Annihilator, Myriad, and the final, glorious counter on my Beastmaster Ascension! It is a work of art! A masterpiece of malevolence!\n\nAnd now, as my opponents hold their breath, trembling on the precipice of their destruction, the game grants me one last moment of exquisite cruelty! It offers me the chance to add yet another flourish to my creation!\n\nMy Oran-Rief! The Vastwood itself thirsts to join the slaughter! It will infuse my newly-birthed Myriad tokens with even more power, making them even more monstrous! It is a small touch, a minor detail, but a true villain delights in the minutiae of misery!\n\nYes! I shall activate Oran-Rief! Let the very land rise up and bless my minions with its dark power!\n\nNow, you sniveling machine, do my bidding! Activate the Vastwood! Mwahahahahaha! CACKLE! More power! MORE!",
