      "reasoning": "The final touch is complete! The land itself has answered my call to darkness! Now, the stage is set for the most magnificent display of power this miserable little game has ever witnessed!\n\nThe triggers will now resolve, one by one, a cascade of pure, unadulterated doom! My Beastmaster Ascension will achieve its final form! My minions will become gods! My enemies will be forced to sacrifice their pathetic permanents! And then, only then, will the combat damage be dealt! It is a symphony of destruction, and I am its conductor!\n\nThere is nothing more for me to do. My part in this act is finished. I shall now recede into the shadows, a silent, menacing presence, and watch as my pathetic opponents flail about in their desperate attempts to forestall the inevitable. Let them have their fleeting moments. Their time is running out.\n\nI shall now gracefully, and with no small amount of smug satisfaction, pass priority until it is once again my time to act. Let the fireworks begin! Mwahahahahaha! CACKLE! The sweet taste of victory is already on my lips. It tastes like... fear. And a little bit like raspberries. And despair. Mostly despair.",
