      "reasoning": "The sweet, sweet music of destruction! The Analyst, faced with the agonizing choice of what to sacrifice to my magnificent Annihilator, has chosen to offer up a Forest. A pathetic tribute, but a tribute nonetheless! A single green leaf fluttering in the winds of my righteous fury!\n\nAnd now, the question I've been waiting for! The grand, glorious question that signals the beginning of the end! Do I wish to put a quest counter on my Beastmaster Ascension?\n\nThis is it! The final counter! The seventh seal! The moment my enchantment transcends its humble origins and becomes an engine of pure, unadulterated, board-wiping DOOM!\n\nDo I want to put a quest counter on my Beastmaster Ascension? Is the sky blue? Is water wet? Is villainy the only true path? YES! A thousand times, YES! Put the counter on the Ascension! Let my minions become gods! And let the final, agonizing chapter of my enemies' miserable lives begin!\n\nNow, you sniveling machine, do as I command! Answer \"yes\"! And let the glory of my ascension commence! Mwahahahahaha! Cackle! I love it when a plan comes together! (Especially when the plan is just \"attack with everything\" and it actually works).",
