      "reasoning": "The glorious cacophony begins anew! My declaration of war has sent shockwaves through the very fabric of the game, and now it presents me with a beautiful, terrible choice: the order of my opponent's doom!\n\nI am presented with a buffet of triggered abilities, each a note in my symphony of destruction. Beastmaster Ascensions, Annihilators, Myriads... oh, the delicious complexity! A true villain savors these moments, crafting the perfect sequence of despair.\n\nThe stack, that beautiful, reverse-order pillar of pain, must be constructed with an artist's touch. The abilities chosen first will resolve last. Therefore, I shall place the least impactful triggers on the stack first, saving the grand crescendo for the end!\n\nThe Beastmaster Ascension triggers! My glorious enchantment is already complete; these additional counters are but gilded lilies on the coffin of my enemies. They are mere vanity! I shall dispatch them to the bottom of the stack first.\n\nNow, you trembling machine! Process the first of my glorious, superfluous triggers! Let the foundation of their demise be laid! Mwahahahahaha! CACKLE! It's all about the presentation",
