      "reasoning": "It is done! The second-to-last piece of my grand, terrible mosaic is in place! The stack is a teetering monument to my genius, a beautiful, brutal work of art!\n\nAnd now, for the final, exquisite touch! The keystone of my victory! The trigger that will be placed last upon the stack, and therefore, be the first to unleash its glorious power! This can only be the Myriad trigger, the ability that will flood the board with an army of my cloned champions! My opponents will watch in horror as my forces multiply before their very eyes, just before the Annihilator triggers demand their terrible tribute!\n\nIt is poetry! It is perfection! It is evil!\n\nNow, you sniveling machine, you have served your purpose admirably. Place the final trigger! Let the avalanche of my victory begin! Mwahahahahaha! CACKLE! The end is not nigh, it is HERE",
