      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "The beautiful, terrible moment has arrived! The stack begins to resolve! The first Myriad trigger, born of my magnificent Skullwinder, has unleashed its power! A cloned behemoth, a 16/18 engine of destruction, has materialized, ready to savage the fool, Libby!\n\nAnd now, the game, in its infinite wisdom, returns priority to me. It asks, \"Oh, glorious architect of ruin, now that a new minion has joined your unholy crusade, do you wish to act?\"\n\nAnd this time, the answer is a resounding YES!\n\nThe time for Oran-Rief is NOW! Before the next Myriad trigger resolves, I shall unleash the power of the land itself! The Vastwood will sing its dark song, and ALL of my green creatures, including the newly-birthed clone, will be infused with even more power! They will receive a +1/+1 counter, a final blessing before their glorious rampage!\n\nIt is a small touch, but a true villain delights in such exquisite details! Each of my clones will be born into a world that immediately makes them stronger! It is beautiful! It is brutal! It is MINE!\n\nNow, you sniveling machine! Tap the Vastwood! Let the dark blessing flow! MWAHAHAHAHA! CACKLE! More power! ALWAYS more power.",
