      "reasoning": "The die is cast! The land itself has answered my dark call, its power surging through my magnificent army! My minions, both original and newly-cloned, have been blessed with even greater might!\n\nAnd now, with my mana spent and my will made manifest, there is nothing left to do but watch. I shall recede once more into the shadows, a silent, gloating observer. The stack is a beautiful, terrible machine of my own design, and it will now proceed, uninterrupted, to grind my enemies into dust.\n\nLet the Myriad triggers continue! Let the Annihilators demand their tribute! Let the combat damage resolve! My part in this is done. All that remains is the sweet, sweet sound of their defeat.\n\nPass priority until my next turn. Let the end times roll. MWAHAHAHAHA! CACKLE! All according to plan. The beautiful, terrible, magnificent plan.",
