    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Gem25P Villain cast Ohran Viper (a creature) before playing a land for the turn. They have multiple lands in hand (Island, Forest, Command Beacon, High Market) and only 7 lands on the battlefield. Playing a land first is almost always correct sequencing — it keeps options open and doesn't reveal information unnecessarily. Additionally, casting a creature before combat when they have Caller of the Pack (8/6 with myriad) ready to attack is questionable, since they should attack first to get combat information before committing more resources to the board. The Ohran Viper could also benefit from seeing combat results first.",
