    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Gem25P Villain has Caller of the Pack (8/6 with trample and myriad) on the battlefield. Attacking with it would create token copies attacking each other opponent, dealing significant damage to all three opponents simultaneously. With Edric, Spymaster of Trest on the board (controlled by Kimi25 Vorthos), any creature dealing combat damage to an opponent lets its controller draw a card - so attacking would also draw Villain cards for each opponent hit. Caller of the Pack is an 8/6 trampler that's very hard to block profitably, and myriad means it attacks all three opponents at once. Skipping this attack wastes a massive damage and card advantage opportunity.",
